For POW, I’d cut Companies House down aggressively. We do **not** care about generic corporate intelligence. We care about signals for **physical capacity under AGI pressure**: electricians, HVAC, grid work, solar/battery installers, data-centre contractors, electronics repair, machinery repair, telecoms, networking, robotics integration, industrial controls, compute/mining hardware, logistics, and the small-business/sole-trader layer that actually does the work.

The highest-value UK official-data stack is this:

| Feed                                    | What POW extracts                                                     | Access                         |
| --------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| **Companies House stream**              | new firms, SIC changes, charges, director changes, failures           | real-time stream               |
| **Companies House filings + documents** | accounts, capital, charges, actual filed docs                         | API + Document API             |
| **FCA regulated disclosures / NSM**     | director/PDMR dealings, TR-1 holders, results, prospectuses, placings | free search/download           |
| **FCA short-position data**             | market conviction against UK-listed companies                         | daily CSV/XLSX                 |
| **Takeover Panel Rule 8**               | hedge-fund/arb positions during takeovers                             | public disclosures             |
| **Contracts Finder + Find a Tender**    | government demand before revenue appears                              | API/OCDS                       |
| **ONS/DBT business + self-employment**  | sole traders and trade capacity                                       | downloadable official datasets |
| **Apprenticeships**                     | future skilled-trade supply                                           | downloadable CSV               |
| later: planning/grid/Ofgem              | physical buildout                                                     | separate gardens               |

That is much closer to POW.

